  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third Party Monitoring (TPM) to monitor project delivery across Ukraine in hard to reach locations. This will include verification, monitoring and reporting on activities funded under the Ukraine Humanitarian Response Programme. Any other technical assessments required to support understanding of the humanitarian context in Ukraine.</narrative>
